  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<code>locale</code> - the Locale to use for case-insensitive key conversion",
      "translation": "<code>locale</code> - 用于不区分大小写的键转换的 Locale。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Preserves the original order as well as the original casing of keys,\nwhile allowing for contains, get and remove calls with any case of key.",
      "translation": "同时保留原始顺序及键的原始大小写，并允许使用任意大小写的键进行 contains、get 和 remove 调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation converts the key\nto lower-case according to this Map's Locale.",
      "translation": "默认实现会根据此 Map 的区域设置将键转换为小写。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap that wraps a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashMap</code></a>\nwith an initial capacity that can accommodate the specified number of\nelements without any immediate resize/rehash operations to be expected,\nstoring case-insensitive keys according to the default Locale (in lower case).",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 `LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap`，它包装了一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashMap</code></a>`，其初始容量足以容纳指定数量的元素，无需立即进行调整大小或重新哈希操作，并根据默认区域设置（小写）存储不区分大小写的键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap that wraps a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashMap</code></a>\nwith an initial capacity that can accommodate the specified number of\nelements without any immediate resize/rehash operations to be expected,\nstoring case-insensitive keys according to the given Locale (in lower case).",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 `LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap`，它包装了一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashMap</code></a>`，其初始容量足以容纳指定数量的元素，无需立即进行调整大小或重新哈希操作，并根据给定的区域设置（以小写形式）存储不区分大小写的键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the locale used by this <code>LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap</code>.\nUsed for case-insensitive key conversion.",
      "translation": "返回此<code>LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap</code>使用的区域设置。用于不区分大小写的键转换。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap that stores case-insensitive keys\naccording to the default Locale (by default in lower case).",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap，该 Map 根据默认区域设置存储不区分大小写的键（默认为小写）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap that stores case-insensitive keys\naccording to the given Locale (in lower case).",
      "translation": "创建一个根据给定区域设置（以小写形式）存储不区分大小写的键的新 `LinkedCaseInsensitiveMap`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether this map should remove the given eldest entry.",
      "translation": "确定是否应从此 Map 中移除给定的最老条目。",
      "count": 2
    },
